= Votes are cast!

Upon the reopening of parliament after the election. The Labour Party immediately push a motion of no confidence on the new government....




- @cap: And the Liberals vote....


@cap

The Liberal Party chooses to side with Labour. Providing enough votes to oust the Tories. They then opt to support the formation of a Labour minority government. Believing it will quickly fall and electorally benefit them.

- @prove: Prove them wrong

@prove
